    Claude Platform on AWS identifies the workspace of every inference and resource request by the anthropic-workspace-id header. Set workspace_id or the ANTHROPIC_AWS_WORKSPACE_ID environment variable (ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID is not read with the aws block). An alias that only manages workspaces needs one too: any workspace of the same region.
Error at aws.region: Missing AWS Region
    Set aws.region or the AWS_REGION environment variable: it selects the gateway endpoint and the SigV4 signing region, and a workspace is reachable only through the region it was created in.
